<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light"><title>空间工作室 · 家具布置</title><style>__STYLES__</style></head><body>
<header class="app-header"><a class="wordmark" href="#" aria-label="空间工作室"><span class="brand-mark" data-icon="cube"></span><span>空间<span class="brand-light">工作室</span></span></a><span class="header-divider"></span><button class="project-title" id="project-menu"><span>孵化器 · 空间试验</span><span class="tiny" data-icon="chevron"></span></button><span class="project-tag">TEST SPACE</span><nav class="workflow"><button data-stage="replica">01 空间复刻</button><i data-icon="chevron-right"></i><button data-stage="layout" class="active">02 家具摆放</button><i data-icon="chevron-right"></i><button data-stage="design">03 AI 设计与渲染</button></nav><div class="header-actions"><span id="save-status" class="save-status"><i></i>本地方案</span><button class="icon-button" id="undo" title="撤销 · Ctrl Z" aria-label="撤销" data-icon="undo"></button><button class="icon-button" id="redo" title="重做 · Ctrl Shift Z" aria-label="重做" data-icon="redo"></button><button class="quiet-button" id="import"><span data-icon="upload"></span>导入</button><button class="primary-button" id="save"><span data-icon="save"></span>保存方案</button><div class="menu-anchor"><button class="quiet-button export-button" id="export-menu">导出<span data-icon="chevron"></span></button><div class="dropdown" id="export-options" hidden><button id="export-glb"><span data-icon="cube"></span>三维模型 GLB</button><button id="export-image"><span data-icon="image"></span>当前视图 PNG</button><button id="reset-project"><span data-icon="reset"></span>恢复初始测试方案</button></div></div></div></header>
<div class="workbench"><nav class="rail" aria-label="工作面板"><button class="rail-button active" data-panel="library" title="家具库"><span data-icon="armchair"></span><small>家具</small></button><button class="rail-button" data-panel="objects" title="场景对象"><span data-icon="layers"></span><small>对象</small></button><button class="rail-button" data-panel="checks" title="布局检查"><span data-icon="check-circle"></span><small>检查</small><b id="issue-count" hidden>0</b></button><div class="rail-bottom"><button class="rail-button" id="help"><span data-icon="keyboard"></span><small>快捷键</small></button></div></nav>
<aside class="library-panel"><div class="panel-view" id="panel-library"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h1>家具库</h1><p>让空间有自己的样子</p></div><button class="icon-button soft" id="custom-open" title="自定义家具" aria-label="自定义家具" data-icon="plus"></button></div><label class="search"><span data-icon="search"></span><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="搜索家具、品牌或型号…" autocomplete="off"><kbd>/</kbd></label><div class="catalog-tabs"><button data-category="all" class="active">全部</button><button data-category="ikea">IKEA</button><button data-category="desk">桌椅</button><button data-category="storage">收纳</button><button data-category="light">灯具</button></div><button id="tripo-open" class="quiet-button full import-furniture">＋ 扫描 / 图片生成家具 · Tripo</button><div class="collection-banner"><span class="collection-icon" data-icon="sparkles"></span><div><b>小空间，轻改造</b><span>已选宜家家具 · 真实尺寸参考</span></div></div><div class="section-title"><span id="catalog-heading">家具与物件</span><span id="catalog-count"></span></div><div id="catalog" class="product-grid"></div><div class="panel-footer"><span data-icon="mouse"></span><span>拖入场景，或点击 <b>＋</b> 添加</span></div></div>
<div class="panel-view" id="panel-objects" hidden><div class="panel-heading"><div><h1>场景对象</h1><p id="object-count"></p></div></div><div id="object-list" class="object-list"></div><div class="object-room-note"><span data-icon="lock"></span><p>房间结构随方案保存。<button class="text-button" id="room-settings-link">调整房间尺寸</button></p></div></div>
<div class="panel-view" id="panel-checks" hidden><div class="panel-heading"><div><h1>布局检查</h1><p>边摆放，边看空间关系</p></div></div><div class="check-summary" id="check-summary"></div><div class="check-settings"><label>目标通行宽度 <span class="number-field"><input id="clearance" type="number" step="5" min="30" max="200" value="80"><span>cm</span></span></label><p>基于当前门位与家具外包络估算，可调整检查宽度。</p></div><div id="check-list" class="check-list"></div><div class="check-footnote">门窗位置仍待现场确认。当前 7.2㎡ 区域用于布置功能测试。</div></div></aside>
<main class="viewport-shell"><div class="viewport" id="viewport" tabindex="0" aria-label="三维空间，支持选择、移动和旋转家具"><div id="loading" class="loading"><span class="loader"></span><b>正在准备三维空间</b><p>载入房间、家具与光影…</p></div><div id="renderer-error" class="renderer-error" hidden><b>三维视图未能启动</b><p id="renderer-error-text"></p><button class="primary-button" id="error-save">导出当前方案</button></div></div>
<div class="view-switch"><button class="active" data-view="3d"><span data-icon="cube"></span>3D 空间</button><button data-view="2d"><span data-icon="plan"></span>2D 平面</button><button data-view="human"><span data-icon="person"></span>人视漫游</button></div>
<div class="viewport-meta"><span class="floor-tag"><i></i>一层 · 测试空间</span><span id="room-metrics">7.20㎡</span></div>
<div class="tool-dock" aria-label="建模工具"><button class="active" data-tool="select" title="选择 · Space" aria-label="选择"><span data-icon="cursor"></span><kbd>␣</kbd></button><span class="dock-divider"></span><button data-tool="move" title="移动 · M" aria-label="移动"><span data-icon="move"></span><kbd>M</kbd></button><button data-tool="rotate" title="旋转 · Q" aria-label="旋转"><span data-icon="rotate"></span><kbd>Q</kbd></button><button data-tool="scale" title="缩放 · S" aria-label="缩放"><span data-icon="scale"></span><kbd>S</kbd></button><span class="dock-divider"></span><button data-tool="measure" title="测距 · T" aria-label="测距"><span data-icon="ruler"></span><kbd>T</kbd></button><button data-tool="orbit" title="环绕 · O" aria-label="环绕"><span data-icon="orbit"></span><kbd>O</kbd></button><button data-tool="pan" title="平移视角 · H" aria-label="平移视角"><span data-icon="hand"></span><kbd>H</kbd></button></div>
<div id="object-context" class="object-context" hidden><button id="focus" title="聚焦 · F" aria-label="聚焦" data-icon="focus"></button><button id="duplicate" title="复制 · Ctrl D" aria-label="复制" data-icon="copy"></button><span></span><button id="delete" title="删除 · Delete" aria-label="删除" data-icon="trash"></button></div>
<div class="display-controls"><button id="cutaway" class="active" title="自动隐藏前侧墙体"><span data-icon="cutaway"></span>剖切</button><button id="names" title="平面图显示家具名称">文字模式</button><button id="grid" title="显示地面参考网格"><span data-icon="grid"></span>网格</button><button id="door-zones" title="显示门前预留区"><span data-icon="door"></span>门前区域</button><button id="fit" title="显示全部 · Shift Z"><span data-icon="fit"></span></button></div>
<div class="navigation-widget"><button id="nav-top" title="俯视" class="nav-top">TOP</button><button id="nav-iso" title="空间全景" data-icon="cube"></button><div class="axis-labels"><span class="axis-x">X</span><span class="axis-y">Y</span><span class="axis-z">Z</span></div></div>
<div id="world-labels" class="world-labels"></div><div id="snap-hint" class="snap-hint" hidden></div><div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" hidden></div><div id="walk-hint" class="walk-hint" hidden><span data-icon="person"></span>拖动看向 · WASD 行走 · Esc 退出</div>
<footer class="statusbar"><span id="tool-hint">单击选择家具 · 拖动摆放 · 中键环绕 · 右键平移</span><div class="statusbar-right"><button id="snap" class="active"><span data-icon="magnet"></span>吸附 <span id="snap-label">5 cm</span></button><div class="axis-locks"><button data-axis="X" class="axis-x">X</button><button data-axis="Y" class="axis-y">Y</button><button data-axis="Z" class="axis-z">Z</button></div><label class="precision"><span id="precision-label">距离</span><input id="precision" placeholder="输入数值 ↵" inputmode="decimal"><span id="precision-unit">m</span></label></div></footer></main>
<aside class="inspector"><div class="inspector-heading"><span>对象属性</span><span class="property-dot"></span></div><div id="inspector-empty" class="inspector-empty"><span data-icon="cursor"></span><h2>选择一件家具</h2><p>在场景或对象列表中选中家具，调整位置、尺寸与材质。</p><div class="empty-room-info"><span>当前房间</span><b id="empty-room-size">4.00 × 1.80 × 3.00 m</b><button class="text-button" id="empty-room-settings">编辑净尺寸<span data-icon="arrow-right"></span></button></div></div>
<div id="inspector-object" hidden><div class="selected-product"><img id="selected-image" alt="选中家具参考图" hidden><span id="selected-placeholder" data-icon="armchair"></span><div><span class="eyebrow" id="selected-brand">FURNITURE</span><input id="object-name" aria-label="家具名称"><span id="selected-source-type"></span></div></div><section class="property-section"><h2>尺寸 <small>cm</small></h2><div class="size-fields"><label>宽 X<input id="dim-x" type="number" step="1"></label><label>深 Y<input id="dim-y" type="number" step="1"></label><label>高 Z<input id="dim-z" type="number" step="1"></label></div><label class="inline-check"><input id="proportions" type="checkbox">等比例调整</label></section>
<section class="property-section"><h2>位置 <small>cm</small></h2><div class="size-fields"><label class="axis-x">X<input id="pos-x" type="number" step="1"></label><label class="axis-y">Y<input id="pos-y" type="number" step="1"></label><label class="axis-z">底高<input id="pos-z" type="number" step="1"></label></div><div class="rotation-field"><label>旋转角度</label><span class="number-field"><input id="angle" type="number" step="15"><span>°</span></span><button id="rotate-quarter" title="旋转 90°" data-icon="rotate"></button></div></section>
<section class="property-section"><h2>安装方式</h2><select id="mount"><option value="floor">落地 · 贴合地面</option><option value="wall">挂墙 · 跟随墙面</option><option value="ceiling">顶装 · 贴合顶面</option></select><div id="wall-fields" hidden><label>所属墙<select id="wall"></select></label><label>沿墙中心 / cm<input id="wall-u" type="number" step="1"></label></div></section>
<section class="property-section"><h2>外观 <button id="reset-color" class="text-button">商品原色</button></h2><div class="color-swatches" id="colors"></div><p>简化模型配色，商品外观以参考图为准。</p></section><div class="property-actions"><button id="apply" class="primary-button">应用参数</button><a id="product-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hidden>查看宜家商品<span data-icon="external"></span></a></div><div class="selected-checks" id="selected-checks"></div></div></aside></div>
<dialog id="help-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">WORKFLOW & SHORTCUTS</span><h2>把注意力留给空间</h2></div><button class="icon-button" data-close="help-dialog" data-icon="close" aria-label="关闭"></button></div><div class="shortcut-grid"><span>选择</span><kbd>Space</kbd><span>移动</span><kbd>M</kbd><span>旋转</span><kbd>Q</kbd><span>缩放</span><kbd>S</kbd><span>测距</span><kbd>T</kbd><span>环绕</span><kbd>O / 中键</kbd><span>平移视角</span><kbd>H / 右键</kbd><span>轴向锁定</span><kbd>X Y Z / 方向键</kbd><span>复制</span><kbd>Ctrl D</kbd><span>撤销 / 重做</span><kbd>Ctrl Z / Ctrl Shift Z</kbd><span>聚焦 / 全景</span><kbd>F / Shift Z</kbd><span>取消 / 删除</span><kbd>Esc / Delete</kbd></div><p class="dialog-note">移动时按住 Shift 可暂停吸附。选择轴向后，可在右下角输入移动距离（m）、旋转角度或缩放倍率。人视中拖动看向，WASD 行走。</p><div class="renderer-details" id="renderer-details"></div></dialog>
<dialog id="room-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">ROOM DIMENSIONS</span><h2>房间净尺寸</h2></div><button class="icon-button" data-close="room-dialog" data-icon="close" aria-label="关闭"></button></div><div class="room-dimension-fields"><label>长 / cm<input id="room-length" type="number" step="1"></label><label>宽 / cm<input id="room-width" type="number" step="1"></label><label>高 / cm<input id="room-height" type="number" step="1"></label></div><p class="dialog-note">门窗和家具的位置会保留。新尺寸放不下现有对象时，会保留原方案并提示。</p><button class="primary-button" id="apply-room">更新房间</button></dialog>
<dialog id="custom-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR FURNITURE</span><h2>添加自定义家具</h2></div><button class="icon-button" data-close="custom-dialog" data-icon="close" aria-label="关闭"></button></div><label class="dialog-label">家具名称<input id="custom-name" value="自定义家具"></label><div class="room-dimension-fields"><label>宽 / cm<input id="custom-width" type="number" value="80"></label><label>深 / cm<input id="custom-depth" type="number" value="40"></label><label>高 / cm<input id="custom-height" type="number" value="75"></label></div><label class="dialog-label">安装方式<select id="custom-mount"><option value="floor">落地</option><option value="wall">挂墙</option><option value="ceiling">顶装</option></select></label><div class="reference-upload"><button id="pick-reference" class="quiet-button"><span data-icon="image"></span>添加商品参考图</button><span id="reference-name">可选 · JPG / PNG / WebP</span></div><p class="dialog-note">先按尺寸建立简模。也可使用家具库上方的 Tripo 图片生成家具入口，导入实际三维模型。</p><button class="primary-button" id="create-custom">加入家具库</button></dialog>
<input id="import-file" type="file" accept=".json,application/json" hidden><input id="reference-file" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" hidden>
<aside class="stage-panel" id="replica-panel" hidden>
 <div class="stage-heading"><span class="eyebrow">01 / RECONSTRUCT</span><h1>从视频，回到空间</h1><p>抽帧、重建、核对，再开始布置。</p></div>
 <section class="flow-section"><label class="video-drop">上传空间视频<input id="scan-video" type="file" accept="video/*,.mp4,.mov,.mkv"><small>只需要一段环绕拍摄的视频 · 最大 300MB</small></label><label class="inline-check"><input id="scan-cloud" type="checkbox">同时使用 KIRI 云重建（消耗账户额度）</label><button class="primary-button full" id="scan-start">开始空间复刻</button><div id="scan-status" class="flow-status">当前示例：已完成扫描，等待结构核对。</div><progress id="scan-progress" max="100" hidden></progress><div class="seg-switch"><button data-evidence="points">扫描点</button><button data-evidence="segments" class="active">平面分组</button><button data-evidence="vector">矢量房间</button></div><p class="micro-note" id="scan-note">扫描表面采样及几何平面分组，不代表完整语义分割。当前扫描未与实测房间可靠配准。</p></section>
 <section class="flow-section"><h2>确认房间净尺寸 <small>m</small></h2><div class="room-dimension-fields"><label>长<input id="confirm-length" type="number" min=".3" step=".01"></label><label>宽<input id="confirm-width" type="number" min=".3" step=".01"></label><label>高<input id="confirm-height" type="number" min=".3" step=".01"></label></div><button class="quiet-button full" id="confirm-dimensions">更新矢量轮廓</button></section>
 <section class="flow-section"><h2>门窗与已有家具</h2><p class="micro-note">门窗来自视频辅助判断，尺寸待逐项确认。已有家具不会由平面分组自动补全。</p><div id="review-objects"></div><button class="quiet-button full" id="existing-add">添加已有家具记录</button><div id="existing-review"></div></section>
 <section class="flow-section"><h2>网页内核对</h2><div id="review-thread" class="review-thread"></div><textarea id="review-question" rows="3" placeholder="记录问题，例如：窗台高还没量，柜子宽约 80cm。也可以发起一条待回答的问题。"></textarea><div class="button-row"><button class="quiet-button" id="review-ask">发起提问</button><button class="quiet-button" id="review-answer">记录回答 / 备注</button></div></section>
 <div class="stage-sticky"><label class="inline-check"><input id="review-ack" type="checkbox">已核对尺寸，接受已标明的待确认项</label><button class="primary-button full" id="finish-replica">确认空间，开始摆家具 →</button></div>
</aside>
<aside class="stage-panel" id="design-panel" hidden>
 <div class="stage-heading"><span class="eyebrow">03 / DESIGN & RENDER</span><h1>和 AI 一起设计</h1><p>让想法变成可以继续编辑的布置。</p></div>
 <section class="flow-section"><div class="button-row"><button class="quiet-button" id="api-settings">模型与 API 设置</button><span id="connection-status" class="micro-note">检查本地服务…</span></div><div id="chat-messages" class="chat-messages"><div class="chat-message assistant">描述用途、想保留的家具和动线要求。我会读取当前房间与家具库，给出可检查的三维摆放提案。</div></div><textarea id="design-prompt" rows="4" placeholder="例如：保留桌椅，布置一个能接待一人的小空间，保持门前通畅。"></textarea><button class="primary-button full" id="design-send">发送并生成布置提案</button><div id="design-result" class="proposal-card" hidden><p id="proposal-message"></p><pre id="proposal-operations"></pre><p id="proposal-issues" class="micro-note"></p><button class="primary-button full" id="proposal-apply">应用到三维空间</button><button class="quiet-button full" id="proposal-discard">放弃提案</button></div></section>
 <section class="flow-section"><span class="eyebrow">CAMERA TO IMAGE</span><h2>AI 效果渲染</h2><p class="micro-note">先切换人视或调整 3D 视角。渲染发送当前视角截图与设计描述，生成图不改变三维模型。</p><textarea id="render-prompt" rows="3" placeholder="例如：黑白灰极简办公室，柔和日光，保留家具位置和空间结构。"></textarea><button class="quiet-button full" id="render-capture">① 捕获当前视角</button><img id="render-reference" class="render-preview" alt="渲染参考视角" hidden><button class="primary-button full" id="render-send">② 生成效果图</button><p id="render-status" class="flow-status"></p><img id="render-output" class="render-preview" alt="AI 生成效果图" hidden><a id="render-download" class="text-button" download="room-ai-render.png" hidden>保存效果图</a><p class="micro-note">效果图可能偏离尺寸和家具细节，购买与施工仍参考三维方案。</p></section>
</aside>
<aside id="stage-info" class="stage-info" hidden><span class="eyebrow">PROJECT NOTES</span><h2 id="stage-info-title">空间核对</h2><p id="stage-info-body"></p><div id="price-summary"></div></aside>
<dialog id="settings-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">LOCAL PROVIDERS</span><h2>模型与 API 设置</h2></div><button class="icon-button" data-close="settings-dialog" data-icon="close"></button></div><p id="settings-note" class="dialog-note">密钥仅保存到本机 .env.local，网页不会回读密钥。留空保留已有密钥。</p><div class="settings-grid"><section><h3>对话模型 · Chat Completions 兼容</h3><label>API Base URL<input id="cfg-chat-base" placeholder="https://api.deepseek.com/v1"></label><label>模型 ID<input id="cfg-chat-model" placeholder="填写服务商实际提供的模型 ID"></label><label>API Key<input id="cfg-chat-key" type="password" autocomplete="new-password"></label></section><section><h3>图像编辑模型 · Images Edits 兼容</h3><label>API Base URL<input id="cfg-image-base" placeholder="https://你的图像服务/v1"></label><label>模型 ID<input id="cfg-image-model"></label><label>API Key<input id="cfg-image-key" type="password" autocomplete="new-password"></label></section><section><h3>Tripo 图片生成三维家具</h3><label>API Key<input id="cfg-tripo-key" type="password" autocomplete="new-password"></label><label>模型 ID<input id="cfg-tripo-model" value="v3.0-20250812"></label></section><section><h3>KIRI 空间重建</h3><label>API Key<input id="cfg-kiri-key" type="password" autocomplete="new-password"></label><p class="micro-note">现有 KIRI 配置会保留。每次提交云任务均由你点击发起。</p></section></div><button class="primary-button" id="settings-save">保存本机配置</button></dialog>
<dialog id="tripo-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">IMAGE TO FURNITURE</span><h2>扫描 / 图片录入家具</h2></div><button class="icon-button" data-close="tripo-dialog" data-icon="close"></button></div><p class="dialog-note">商品图或实拍图 → Tripo 三维重建 → 确认实际尺寸 → 家具库。也支持直接导入独立 GLB 文件。</p><label class="dialog-label">家具名称<input id="tripo-name" value="我的家具"></label><label class="dialog-label">商品图 / 实拍图<input id="tripo-image" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"></label><div class="room-dimension-fields"><label>宽 / cm<input id="tripo-width" type="number" value="80"></label><label>深 / cm<input id="tripo-depth" type="number" value="40"></label><label>高 / cm<input id="tripo-height" type="number" value="75"></label></div><label class="dialog-label">安装方式<select id="tripo-mount"><option value="floor">落地</option><option value="wall">挂墙</option><option value="ceiling">顶装</option></select></label><label class="dialog-label">参考价 / 元（选填）<input id="tripo-price" type="number" min="0" step=".01"></label><div class="button-row"><button class="primary-button" id="tripo-submit">提交 Tripo 重建</button><button class="quiet-button" id="tripo-config">配置 API</button></div><p id="tripo-status" class="flow-status">图片无法可靠恢复实际尺寸，请填写或核对实测尺寸。</p><progress id="tripo-progress" max="100" hidden></progress><div class="flow-section"><label class="dialog-label">或导入已有 GLB<input id="tripo-glb" type="file" accept=".glb,model/gltf-binary"></label><button class="quiet-button" id="tripo-import-glb">按以上尺寸录入 GLB</button></div></dialog>
<script id="scan-evidence" type="application/json">__EVIDENCE__</script>

<script id="initial-scene" type="application/json">__SCENE__</script><script>__BUNDLE__</script></body></html>
